Escape(Q&A)  = [Q&amp;A]
Escape(a<b>c) = [a&lt;b&gt;c]
Escape(&lt;) escapes the ampersand once = [&amp;lt;]
Escape of text with no special characters = [plain words]
Escape of empty text = []
EscapeAttribute(a=1&b=2) = [a=1&amp;b=2]
EscapeAttribute of a double quote, shown raw as a marker = [say &quot;hi&quot;]
EscapeForScript(x < y) = [x \u003c y]
EscapeForScript of a double quote = [\[quote]]
EscapeForScript of a line feed = [a\nb]
EscapeForScript of a backslash = [a\\b]
